{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2020/06/mobility-challenged-hero.webp" alt="Mobility challenged" width="1080" height="747" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>Singer Kitchens can Accommodate even the Most Unique Needs</h1><h2>From Singer Kitchens Serving New Orleans &amp; the Northshore</h2><div class="el-text"><p>These days, every home has specific needs that must be met and the team at Singer Kitchens has the experience to ensure that they are – every time.  Whether you need additional room in your design to accommodate a walker or wheelchair, or simply want everything within easier reach, Singer’s Universal Design cabinets and design expertise will make your wishes a reality AND maintain your sense of style.  These cabinets are engineered to meet any level of mobility and are a plus when considering a new kitchen that will accommodate everyone from children through those dealing with changing levels of ability.</p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
